sequenceDiagram
  actor Officer
  participant API
  participant DB as Database
  participant Relay as OutboxDispatcher
  participant Bus as Event bus
  participant H as Handlers

  Officer->>API: POST /api/claims/42/approve
  API->>API: state machine and four-eyes check
  API->>DB: ONE transaction (claim, history row, outbox row)
  API-->>Officer: 200 with the updated claim
  loop polls every 300 ms
    Relay->>DB: read unsent outbox rows
    Relay->>Bus: publish ClaimApproved (key = claim id)
  end
  Bus->>H: ClaimApproved
  H->>DB: notification for the claimant, exposure bucket recomputed
  Note over Officer,H: The SPA polls every few seconds, so the claimant's bell lights up shortly after.
